! CH3CHO | Bare acetaldehyde at wB97X-D/6-21G+(d,p)/SMD(water) -- bare single point diagnostic
!
! Diagnostic variant after 6 failed real attempts (8/1/4/8 cores, plus a
! GUESS=HCORE variant) of the optimization version, all failing right as
! the first SCF iteration begins. EXETYP=CHECK passed cleanly; geometry
! bond distances confirmed completely sensible (C-C 1.493 A, C=O 1.255 A,
! all C-H 1.09-1.10 A -- matching a genuine, converged, zero-imaginary-
! frequency plain-PCM minimum). FIXPVA (SMD's recommended tessellation)
! confirmed already default.
!
! This strips out ALL optimization/search machinery (RUNTYP=ENERGY, no
! $STATPT, no $ZMAT, no $FORCE) to isolate whether the problem is the
! basic SCF+SMD combination itself, or something specific to the
! optimization machinery layered on top.

 $BASIS GBASIS=N21 NGAUSS=6 NDFUNC=1 NPFUNC=1 DIFFSP=.t. $END
 $CONTRL SCFTYP=RHF RUNTYP=ENERGY $END
 $CONTRL DFTTYP=wB97X-D $END
 $SCF DIIS=.t. DAMP=.t. $END
 $PCM SOLVNT=WATER SMD=.T. $END
 $SYSTEM MWORDS=50 MEMDDI=50 $END
!$CONTRL EXETYP=CHECK $END

 $DATA
Acetaldehyde, bare, for hydration thermodynamic cycle -- SMD variant
